### Create customer (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Trading", "email": "buyer@acme.co.za", "countryCode": "ZA" }

### Duplicate email (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Again", "email": "BUYER@acme.co.za", "countryCode": "ZA" }

### Non-SADC country (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nairobi Ltd", "email": "x@nairobi.co.ke", "countryCode": "KE" }

### Search (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?search=acme&page=1&pageSize=10

### pageSize > 100 (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?pageSize=101

### Get by id: paste an id from the create response (200 / 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### Create order (201, ETag header, total = 24.75)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "currencyCode": "ZAR",
  "lineItems": [
    { "productSku": "PEN-BLUE", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 10.50 },
    { "productSku": "MUG-WHITE", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 1.25 }
  ]
}

### Wrong currency for ZA customer (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "currencyCode": "USD", "lineItems": [ { "productSku": "X", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1 } ] }

### Bad lines: qty 0, 3 decimals (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "currencyCode": "ZAR", "lineItems": [ { "productSku": "X", "quantity": 0, "unitPrice": 1.005 } ] }

### Get order (200, note the ETag response header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Get with If-None-Match (304): paste the ETag value incl. quotes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
If-None-Match: "AAAAAAAAB9k="

### List: filter + sort + page (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&status=Pending&sort=-total&page=1&pageSize=10

### Invalid sort (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?sort=name

### Pending -> Paid (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c9a52-0001-4b1e-9d1a-000000000001

{ "status": "Paid" }

### Same key, same body: replayed (200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true, no second change)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c9a52-0001-4b1e-9d1a-000000000001

{ "status": "Paid" }

### Same key, different body (422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c9a52-0001-4b1e-9d1a-000000000001

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### No Idempotency-Key (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Delivered" }

### Invalid transition: Paid -> Pending (422, code order.invalid_transition)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c9a52-0001-4b1e-9d1a-000000000002

{ "status": "Pending" }

### Stale If-Match (412)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c9a52-0001-4b1e-9d1a-000000000003
If-Match: "AAAAAAAAAAA="

{ "status": "Delivered" }

### No token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Reader cannot create (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nope", "email": "nope@x.co.za", "countryCode": "ZA" }

### Reader can read (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Correlation id echoed (check X-Correlation-ID response header + console log)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: test-corr-123

### Liveness (200, no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness (200 Healthy; stop SQL Server to see 503)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readiness

### Metrics (Prometheus text)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics